// Container for the lobby name tags. One child per visible non-teammate, pooled and repositioned
// every frame by BattleRoyaleLobbyTags.
//
// Full-screen frame with hexactsize 0 / vexactsize 0, which is the ONE container shape whose
// GetScreenSize reports real pixels - so children SetPos'd in pixels land where they are put. A
// fixed-pixel container would render at viewport/1920 of its declared width while its children were
// laid out in the declared units, which shifts the whole group while its spacing stays correct.
//
// priority sits below the admin spectator overlay (50) and above the party name tags (none). The
// three never draw the same character anyway: party members are excluded from this one, and an
// admin spectator has Party's HUD suppressed - but the ordering makes that a belt as well as braces.
PanelWidgetClass LobbyTagsRoot {
 visible 1
 ignorepointer 1
 position 0 0
 size 1 1
 hexactpos 0
 vexactpos 0
 hexactsize 0
 vexactsize 0
 priority 40
 color 0 0 0 0
 {
 }
}
